*
!.gitignore
!composer/
!composer/**
!tasks/
!tasks/**
!glossaries/
!glossaries/**
!icon/
!icon/**
!readme/
!readme/**
# The macOS worker's signing entitlements (non-secret build input; committed)
!macos/
!macos/shell-worker.entitlements
# The Windows installer script (gh-91), compiled by grafida/shell-packager
!shell-windows-installer.nsi
# Private build configuration: the sample is committed; build.properties (real
# secrets) stays ignored by the * rule above and must NEVER be committed.
!build.sample.properties
